/-!
# Recognition of the actual ternary G₂ parabolic completion

Every faithful completion of the actual G₂(3) parabolic amalgam admitting
endpoint involutions outside the whole Borel whose product has order six
is isomorphic to `Atlas.G2.Model (ZMod 3)`. The proof establishes hexagon
smallness, the canonical Weyl relation and injectivity of both projections
from the paired completion. Ambient finiteness is unnecessary.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith F.3.6, F.4.8 and F.4.26, printed pp.272, 278 and 288.
-/
